  "question": {
    "text": "A process has <math><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>J</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>J</mi><msup><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> Out of the values given below choose the minimum temperature above which the process will be spontaneous:",
